  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s01-flow",
      "intent": "The recurrence returns to the DQ-CTM thought stage, not around the whole image-to-image flow.",
      "claim": "ThinkSR runs end to end through encoder, windows, shared DQ-CTM ticks, and decoder.",
      "narration": "The image first becomes a feature field before any thought step runs. The field is partitioned into windows so the dense carrier remains present. The DQ-CTM block is the recurring part of the method. The loop returns only to that thought stage, while the surrounding flow stays fixed. The same parameters are reused across ticks rather than adding a new block each time.",
